## Why This Is Asked
Tests memory ownership across CGO, how to copy nested C data into Go, and proper cleanup in both directions. It also checks error propagation when allocations fail.

## Key Concepts
- CGO memory ownership and deep copies
- Converting C arrays to Go slices
